<title>INDIA: India 96/97 cement output rises to 76.18 mln T.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 cement output rises to 76.18 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 76.18 million tonnes of cement in 1996/97 (April-March) compared with 69.55 million in 1995/96, the government said in its monthly economic report on Saturday.</p>
</text>
